<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>MPI Qur'an Hadis - Keutamaan Memberi (Kelas 6 MI)</title>
    <!-- Google Fonts for Storybook & Clean Typography -->
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Fredoka:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Plus+Jakarta+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700;800&family=Scheherazade+New:wght@600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    
    <style>
        :root {
            --primary-yellow: #FFB800;
            --primary-yellow-light: #FFF8E7;
            --primary-yellow-hover: #FFA000;
            --accent-amber: #FF8F00;
            --accent-green: #10B981;
            --accent-green-light: #ECFDF5;
            --accent-blue: #3B82F6;
            --accent-red: #EF4444;
            --bg-white: #FFFFFF;
            --bg-cream: #FFFDF7;
            --text-dark: #1F2937;
            --text-muted: #6B7280;
            --border-yellow: #FFE082;
            --shadow-card: 0 10px 25px -5px rgba(255, 184, 0, 0.15), 0 8px 10px -6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.05);
            --shadow-storybook: 0 12px 0 0 #F59E0B;
            --radius-xl: 24px;
            --radius-lg: 16px;
            --radius-md: 12px;
        }

        * {
            box-sizing: border-box;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            font-family: 'Plus Jakarta Sans', sans-serif;
            -webkit-tap-highlight-color: transparent;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-cream);
            color: var(--text-dark);
            min-height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            background-image: 
                radial-gradient(var(--border-yellow) 1px, transparent 1px),
                radial-gradient(var(--border-yellow) 1px, var(--bg-cream) 1px);
            background-size: 40px 40px;
            background-position: 0 0, 20px 20px;
            overflow-x: hidden;
        }

        header {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
            backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
            border-bottom: 3px solid var(--border-yellow);
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 15px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.03);
        }

        .nav-container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 12px 20px;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .brand-logo {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--text-dark);
        }

        .brand-icon {
            background: var(--primary-yellow);
            width: 44px;
            height: 44px;
            border-radius: 14px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 0 #D97706;
            font-size: 22px;
        }

        .brand-title {
            font-family: 'Fredoka', cursive;
            font-size: 1.25rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #92400E;
            line-height: 1.2;
        }

        .brand-subtitle {
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .nav-menu {
            display: flex;
            gap: 8px;
            align-items: center;
            list-style: none;
        }

        .nav-btn {
            padding: 8px 16px;
            border-radius: var(--radius-md);
            border: 2px solid transparent;
            background: transparent;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: var(--text-dark);
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
        }

        .nav-btn:hover {
            background: var(--primary-yellow-light);
            border-color: var(--border-yellow);
        }

        .nav-btn.active {
            background: var(--primary-yellow);
            color: #78350F;
            border-color: #F59E0B;
            box-shadow: 0 3px 0 #D97706;
        }

        .sound-btn {
            background: #FEF3C7;
            border: 2px solid #FCD34D;
            border-radius: 50%;
            width: 40px;
            height: 40px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 18px;
            transition: transform 0.2s ease;
        }

        .sound-btn:active {
            transform: scale(0.9);
        }

        main {
            flex: 1;
            max-width: 1100px;
            width: 100%;
            margin: 20px auto;
            padding: 0 20px 40px;
        }

        .view-section {
            display: none;
            animation: fadeInSlide 0.4s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) forwards;
        }

        .view-section.active {
            display: block;
        }

        @keyframes fadeInSlide {
            from {
                opacity: 0;
                transform: translateY(15px);
            }
            to {
                opacity: 1;
                transform: translateY(0);
            }
        }

        .card {
            background: var(--bg-white);
            border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
            border: 3px solid var(--border-yellow);
            padding: 28px;
            box-shadow: var(--shadow-card);
            margin-bottom: 24px;
            position: relative;
        }

        .cover-hero {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFFBEB 0%, #FEF3C7 100%);
            border: 4px solid #FCD34D;
            border-radius: 32px;
            padding: 40px;
            text-align: center;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: 0 16px 0 0 #F59E0B;
            margin-bottom: 35px;
        }

        .cover-badge {
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 8px;
            background: #FFFFFF;
            padding: 8px 20px;
            border-radius: 50px;
            border: 2px solid #FBBF24;
            font-weight: 800;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: #B45309;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 0 #F59E0B;
        }

        .cover-title {
            font-family: 'Fredoka', cursive;
            font-size: 3rem;
            color: #78350F;
            line-height: 1.15;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
            text-shadow: 2px 2px 0 #FEF3C7;
        }

        .cover-subtitle {
            font-size: 1.3rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #92400E;
            max-width: 700px;
            margin: 0 auto 25px;
        }

        .arabic-banner {
            font-family: 'Scheherazade New', serif;
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            color: #1E3A8A;
            direction: rtl;
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.85);
            padding: 16px 24px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            border: 2px dashed #93C5FD;
            display: inline-block;
            margin: 15px 0 30px;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.04);
        }

        .cover-actions {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
            gap: 16px;
            max-width: 850px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }

        .btn-action {
            padding: 16px 24px;
            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            cursor: pointer;
            border: none;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 10px;
            transition: all 0.15s ease;
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .btn-primary-start {
            background: #10B981;
            color: #FFFFFF;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 0 #047857;
        }

        .btn-primary-start:hover {
            background: #059669;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .btn-primary-start:active {
            transform: translateY(4px);
            box-shadow: 0 2px 0 #047857;
        }

        .btn-secondary-info {
            background: #FFFFFF;
            color: #78350F;
            border: 3px solid #FCD34D;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 0 #F59E0B;
        }

        .btn-secondary-info:hover {
            background: #FFFBEB;
            transform: translateY(-2px);
        }

        .btn-secondary-info:active {
            transform: translateY(4px);
            box-shadow: 0 2px 0 #F59E0B;
        }

        .developer-card {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #EFF6FF 0%, #DBEAFE 100%);
            border: 3px solid #BFDBFE;
            border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
            padding: 24px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 20px;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }

        .dev-avatar {
            width: 70px;
            height: 70px;
            background: #3B82F6;
            color: white;
            border-radius: 50%;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 32px;
            border: 4px solid #FFFFFF;
            box-shadow: 0 6px 12px rgba(59, 130, 246, 0.3);
            flex-shrink: 0;
        }

        .dev-details h4 {
            color: #1E40AF;
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            margin-bottom: 4px;
        }

        .dev-details p {
            color: #1E3A8A;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .dev-tag {
            display: inline-block;
            background: #93C5FD;
            color: #1E3A8A;
            padding: 2px 10px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 0.75rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            margin-top: 6px;
        }

        .slide-container {
            min-height: 420px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: space-between;
        }

        .slide-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            border-bottom: 2px dashed var(--border-yellow);
            padding-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .slide-title {
            font-family: 'Fredoka', cursive;
            font-size: 1.6rem;
            color: #78350F;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .slide-counter {
            background: var(--primary-yellow-light);
            color: #B45309;
            border: 2px solid var(--border-yellow);
            padding: 4px 14px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-weight: 800;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
        }

        .slide-content {
            font-size: 1.05rem;
            line-height: 1.7;
            color: #374151;
            flex: 1;
        }

        .arabic-text {
            font-family: 'Scheherazade New', serif;
            font-size: 2.2rem;
            line-height: 2.2;
            text-align: right;
            direction: rtl;
            background: #FFFBEB;
            padding: 20px 24px;
            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
            border-right: 6px solid #F59E0B;
            margin: 15px 0;
        }

        .slide-nav {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            margin-top: 25px;
            padding-top: 15px;
            border-top: 2px solid var(--primary-yellow-light);
        }

        .mufradat-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
            gap: 15px;
            margin-top: 15px;
        }

        .vocab-card {
            background: #FFFFFF;
            border: 2px solid #FCD34D;
            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
            padding: 16px;
            text-align: center;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 0 #F59E0B;
        }

        .vocab-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-3px);
            background: #FFFBEB;
        }

        .vocab-arabic {
            font-family: 'Scheherazade New', serif;
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            color: #065F46;
            margin-bottom: 6px;
        }

        .vocab-latin {
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #D97706;
            font-size: 0.95rem;
        }

        .vocab-meaning {
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            color: var(--text-muted);
            margin-top: 4px;
        }

        .sim-box {
            background: #F0FDF4;
            border: 3px solid #6EE7B7;
            border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
            padding: 24px;
        }

        .sim-metrics {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
            gap: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 24px;
        }

        .metric-card {
            background: #FFFFFF;
            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
            padding: 16px;
            border: 2px solid #A7F3D0;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.02);
        }

        .metric-val {
            font-size: 1.8rem;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #047857;
            margin: 6px 0;
        }

        .progress-bar-bg {
            background: #E5E7EB;
            height: 12px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            overflow: hidden;
            margin-top: 8px;
        }

        .progress-bar-fill {
            height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, #10B981 0%, #059669 100%);
            width: 0%;
            transition: width 0.4s ease;
        }

        .sim-slider-group {
            background: #FFFFFF;
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
            border: 2px solid #E5E7EB;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .sim-slider-label {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            color: #1F2937;
        }

        input[type="range"] {
            width: 100%;
            height: 8px;
            border-radius: 5px;
            background: #E5E7EB;
            outline: none;
            accent-color: #10B981;
            cursor: pointer;
        }

        .sim-feedback {
            background: #ECFDF5;
            border: 2px dashed #059669;
            padding: 18px;
            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
            margin-top: 20px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: flex-start;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .quiz-reg-box {
            max-width: 500px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .form-input {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 14px 18px;
            border: 2px solid var(--border-yellow);
            border-radius: var(--radius-md);
            font-size: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
            outline: none;
            transition: border-color 0.2s;
        }

        .form-input:focus {
            border-color: #F59E0B;
            box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(245, 158, 11, 0.2);
        }

        .quiz-question-card {
            background: #FFFFFF;
            border: 2px solid var(--border-yellow);
            border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
            padding: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .question-number {
            display: inline-block;
            background: var(--primary-yellow);
            color: #78350F;
            font-weight: 800;
            padding: 4px 12px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            font-size: 0.85rem;
            margin-bottom: 12px;
        }

        .question-text {
            font-size: 1.1rem;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: #1F2937;
            margin-bottom: 18px;
            line-height: 1.5;
        }

        .option-list {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 12px;
        }

        .option-item {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            padding: 14px 18px;
            border: 2px solid #E5E7EB;
            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
            font-weight: 600;
            background: #FFFFFF;
        }

        .option-item:hover {
            border-color: #FCD34D;
            background: #FFFBEB;
        }

        .option-item.selected {
            border-color: #F59E0B;
            background: #FEF3C7;
            color: #78350F;
        }

        .option-item input {
            margin-right: 14px;
            width: 18px;
            height: 18px;
            accent-color: #F59E0B;
        }

        .matching-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 20px;
            margin-top: 15px;
        }

        .matching-column {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 10px;
        }

        .match-card {
            padding: 12px 16px;
            background: #F9FAFB;
            border: 2px solid #E5E7EB;
            border-radius: var(--radius-md);
            cursor: pointer;
            font-weight: 600;
            text-align: center;
            transition: all 0.2s ease;
        }

        .match-card.selected-left {
            background: #DBEAFE;
            border-color: #3B82F6;
            color: #1E40AF;
        }

        .match-card.matched {
            background: #D1FAE5;
            border-color: #10B981;
            color: #065F46;
            cursor: default;
        }

        .score-display-box {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 30px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #FFFBEB 0%, #FEF3C7 100%);
            border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
            border: 3px solid #FCD34D;
            margin-bottom: 30px;
        }

        .score-badge {
            font-size: 3.5rem;
            font-weight: 900;
            color: #B45309;
            font-family: 'Fredoka', cursive;
        }

        .review-card {
            background: #FFFFFF;
            border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
            padding: 20px;
            border: 2px solid #E5E7EB;
            margin-bottom: 16px;
        }

        .review-card.correct {
            border-left: 6px solid #10B981;
        }

        .review-card.incorrect {
            border-left: 6px solid #EF4444;
        }

        .pembahasan-box {
            background: #F8FAFC;
            border-radius: var(--radius-md);
            padding: 12px 16px;
            margin-top: 10px;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: #334155;
            border: 1px solid #E2E8F0;
        }

        .modal-overlay {
            position: fixed;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            bottom: 0;
            background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5);
            backdrop-filter: blur(4px);
            display: none;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            z-index: 1000;
            padding: 20px;
        }

        .modal-overlay.active {
            display: flex;
        }

        .modal-box {
            background: #FFFFFF;
            border-radius: var(--radius-xl);
            max-width: 650px;
            width: 100%;
            padding: 30px;
            border: 4px solid var(--border-yellow);
            box-shadow: 0 20px 25px -5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);
            max-height: 85vh;
            overflow-y: auto;
        }

        .modal-header {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            border-bottom: 2px solid var(--primary-yellow-light);
            padding-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .modal-close-btn {
            background: #F3F4F6;
            border: none;
            width: 36px;
            height: 36px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #4B5563;
        }

        /* Database Status Pill Badge */
        .db-status-badge {
            background: #EFF6FF;
            border: 2px solid #BFDBFE;
            color: #1E40AF;
            padding: 6px 14px;
            border-radius: 20px;
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 0.8rem;
            display: inline-flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 6px;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .cover-title {
                font-size: 2.2rem;
            }
            .arabic-banner {
                font-size: 1.6rem;
            }
            .arabic-text {
                font-size: 1.8rem;
            }
            .nav-menu {
                display: flex;
                gap: 4px;
            }
            .nav-btn span {
                display: none;
            }
            .nav-btn {
                padding: 8px 10px;
            }
            .matching-grid {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <div class="nav-container">
            <a href="#" class="brand-logo" onclick="switchTab('cover'); return false;">
                <div class="brand-icon">🎁</div>
                <div>
                    <div class="brand-title">MPI QUR'AN HADIS</div>
                    <div class="brand-subtitle">Kelas 6 MI • Fase C</div>
                </div>
            </a>
            <ul class="nav-menu">
                <li><button class="nav-btn active" id="btn-cover" onclick="switchTab('cover')">🏠 <span>Beranda</span></button></li>
                <li><button class="nav-btn" id="btn-materi" onclick="switchTab('materi')">📖 <span>Materi</span></button></li>
                <li><button class="nav-btn" id="btn-simulasi" onclick="switchTab('simulasi')">✨ <span>Simulasi</span></button></li>
                <li><button class="nav-btn" id="btn-evaluasi" onclick="switchTab('evaluasi')">📝 <span>Evaluasi</span></button></li>
                <li><button class="sound-btn" id="sound-toggle" onclick="toggleAudio()" title="Efek Suara">🔊</button></li>
            </ul>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main>
        <!-- View Cover / Beranda -->
        <section id="view-cover" class="view-section active">
            <div class="cover-hero">
                <div class="cover-badge">✨ Media Pembelajaran Interaktif Modular</div>
                <h1 class="cover-title">KEUTAMAAN MEMBERI</h1>
                <p class="cover-subtitle">Menerapkan Isi Kandungan Hadis tentang Keutamaan Memberi dalam Kehidupan Sehari-hari</p>
                <div class="arabic-banner">
                    الْيَدُ الْعُلْيَا خَيْرٌ مِنَ الْيَدِ السُّفْلَى
                </div>
                <div class="cover-actions">
                    <button class="btn-action btn-primary-start" onclick="switchTab('materi')">
                        🚀 Mulai Belajar
                    </button>
                    <button class="btn-action btn-secondary-info" onclick="openModal('modal-tujuan')">
                        🎯 Tujuan
                    </button>
                    <button class="btn-action btn-secondary-info" onclick="openModal('modal-referensi')">
                        📚 Referensi
                    </button>
                    <button class="btn-action btn-secondary-info" style="border-color:#60A5FA; color:#1E40AF;" onclick="openModal('modal-db-config')">
                        ⚙️ Database
                    </button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="developer-card">
                <div class="dev-avatar">👨‍🏫</div>
                <div class="dev-details">
                    <h4>KARLIN S. ALIM</h4>
                    <p>Guru & Pengembang Media • MIS ALFALAH</p>
                    <span class="dev-tag">Kanwil Kemenag Provinsi Gorontalo</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section id="view-materi" class="view-section">
            <div class="card slide-container">
                <div>
                    <div class="slide-header">
